  "idea": "Automated creative asset tagging and DAM library for agency designers",
  "text": "Here is how design agencies organize 50,000 raw video clips, logos, and fonts across thirty clients. Editors waste hours digging through messy Drive folders, guessing versions, and begging teammates for vector assets. Unstructured cloud storage lacks metadata tagging, creating painful bottlenecks and duplicated creative work. Connect Google Drive to Brandfolder using Make to automatically tag and index every incoming asset. Your team locates any file in five seconds.",
